@startuml
start
:Client sends a message;
:System creates a new Conversation;
if (Is an operator available?) then (Yes)
  :System assigns Conversation to the operator;
else (No)
  :Conversation is added to the queue;
  :Wait for an available operator;
  :Assign to an operator;
endif
:Operator receives a notification;
:Operator starts working on the Conversation;
stop
@enduml